con.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">671d972d-2461-4fc6-8860-a952b6bdec8c</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:671d972d-2461-4fc6-8860-a952b6bdec8c\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:671d972d-2461-4fc6-8860-a952b6bdec8c\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n      <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<p>The Stone Lord's skull echoes with absence, and the tadpole alone is not enough to fill it. Take on the crone's dust-pocked form and fill his thoughts with old adventures, so that he might smile sweetly while he slaughters for us.\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p><br>\nAnd do <b>not</b> pulp <a href=\"/wiki/Boo\" title=\"Boo\">the rodent</a>. If its chittering gives the Stone Lord pause, then set it aside for me - so that we might give the great hero a final meal when his work is done.\n</p><p>-Orin\n</p>\n</div>    \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714202849\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.061 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.064 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2347/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 32930/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 9477/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 5/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.012/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 939186/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion ex